    "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2022 the Syndicate held $2,896.5m of gross claims outstanding. During 2022 the Syndicate recorded a release of technical reserves in respect of prior years of $85.9m, reflecting predominantly favourable claims development in Political Risk & Violence, Marine and Property lines. The release partly offsets strengthening elsewhere driven by catastrophe events in 2022 (notably Hurricane Ian and losses arising from the Russia/Ukraine crisis) and inflationary pressures on claim costs. The Syndicate continues to hold significant gross reserves and provides disclosure of its major prior-year and current-year event exposures.",
